# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository AND in the working tree.
#
# Why eol=lf and not just text=auto: the team works on Windows, where
# core.autocrlf=true checks files out as CRLF. Prettier is configured
# "endOfLine": "lf" (.prettierrc), so every line in a CRLF file became a
# `Delete ␍` lint error — 6,690 of them, which made `npm run lint` unusable.
# This file overrides core.autocrlf for everyone, so checkouts stay LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only scripts must keep CRLF or PowerShell/cmd can mis-parse them.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary — never touch, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary

# Generated — collapse in PR diffs.
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo -diff
